{
  "about": "SL-20 exact-origin vectors (FR-VAULT-04), shared by packages/core/test/autofill-origin.test.ts and OriginMatchTest.kt in apps/mobile/modules/hermit-autofill. 'logins' (SL-36) are the vault logins offered for a request: the index holds each item's id hash ('ref'), name and origins, never a secret. Digests are SHA-256 of the signing certificate, base64url without padding. The digests in 'browsers' and 'cases' are placeholders, not real keys; 'productionBrowsers' is the shipped allowlist, which both implementations must equal.",
